You got most of it already, but in ascending order of importance:

6) keep plenty of food on hand for the planes (stock your bag with K-
rations and C-rations)
5) if you're worried about umber-hulk-caused-confusion, don't wear a
towel; keep your blessed unicorn horn on hand to cure yourself.
4) keep potions of holy water/scrolls of remove curse in your bag for
the ascension run (whenever you feel a "malignant aura," check to see
what's been uncursed/cursed.  rebless your BoH as soon as it becomes
uncursed, because it weighs significantly less when blessed.)
3) don't drop your bag!
2) as much as possible, run, don't fight, your way through the planes.
(a ring of conflict will help you a lot with this)
1) always always always keep a lizard corpse in open inventory!

